[10:08] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'never looks right. You\'ll get half of the image. The head might be not there. So, yeah, I recommend using longest edge. I\'m going to keep it on the default 1,024 pixels. You also have the ability to change the amount of images'

[10:20] [scene:talk]
